# Mobile-First Requirements (Non-Negotiable)

All features must be playable and optimized for mobile.

Requirements:
- Touch-friendly UI (thumb-safe sizes and spacing)
- Avoid heavy visuals, excessive particles, expensive post effects
- Avoid expensive per-frame loops on client
- Use efficient replication and keep Remote traffic minimal

Always test assumptions for:
- low-end devices
- poor network conditions
- smaller screens / safe areas

Provide performance-safe defaults and allow scaling via config.
